              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='12'>Population context and full-dataset KPIs summarize the selected group; quarterly trends and comparison charts show how search and yield patterns vary.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
